{"script":"yd_005_07","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","timeBak":300,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"nonStandBright":false,"x":280,"transTime":0,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]在大兽潮爆发的时候，我在魔爪沼泽的聚落遭到袭击。我本来就不太擅长逃跑，差点送了命，是驿站联军救了我。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]那时赶来救援的，就是菲尔德蕾老板带领的契约者义士。[r]而将我从魔物口中救下的，就是迦南前辈。我虽然失去了双腿，但好歹是得救了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]后来大兽潮结束，菲尔德蕾面对四散的联盟，仍然在驿站坚持着契约者制度。[r]能重新走路的我成了驿站的侍者，也申请加入了契约者的队伍。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]虽说我是想回报欠下的恩情才加入的，但近些年的工作也越来越多。[r]唉……只有来你这儿歇脚的时候才能睡个饱觉。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]啊……抱歉，一不小心说太多自己的那些往事了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]唉？你对这些也很感兴趣？[r]是吗……那下次，也和我讲讲你过去的事情吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-亲密1"}